OL,5,G1925 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe B&Bers meet for one last time
OL,7,     Fto find out how much they've been
OL,8,     Fpaid and to thrash out their
OL,9,     Fdifferences. There's trouble as
OL,10,     FMrs Tee and Alistair and Emma
OL,11,     Fclash over their scores.
OL,12,G2000 Griff's Canadian Adventure
OL,13,     FFrom film sets in Toronto to
OL,14,     FNiagara Falls to forested national
OL,15,     Fparks, Griff Rhys Jones uncovers
OL,16,     Fhow Canadians differ from their
OL,17,     Fsouthern neighbours, and what
OL,18,     Fmakes them so nice. (Ep3/6)
